# TASKS.md is git-ignored

The running task list lives in `TASKS.md` in this directory and is deliberately
not committed: it carries outreach notes, contact plans and assessments of other
projects that have no business being public.

A fresh clone will not have it, and nothing depends on it. The engineering state
and the work queue are in [`HANDOVER.md`](./HANDOVER.md), which is committed.

If you are continuing this work and want the private list, it is on Mandeep's
machine at the repository root.
